## VoiceMap — monster type -> Phase 1 vocal pool mapping (Wave 2, voice wiring).
##
## Data only: no playback lives here. AudioManager.play_monster_vocal() reads
## these tables. Every path below passed Layer 1 scripted analysis (see
## assets/resources-phase1/audio/analysis/layer1_results.json); the single
## flagged file is listed in FLAGGED_FILES and appears in NO pool.
## Exception (Nov 4-7): the kappa, frog, and harpy pool clips are
## James-approved, verified by equivalent checks (see their pool notes) —
## the Layer 1 script is not checked in.
##
## Honest limits, from the Phase 1 catalog: no per-monster vocals exist in any
## free pack found — all mapping is family-level. Packs are not split by
## context (idle/attack/death), so contexts share the pool except banshee
## (breath idle, scream attack/death, per the catalog's layering suggestion).
## Apex bosses are Wave 4: APEX_VOCAL_POOLS names POOLS ONLY, no clips, and
## apex voices are never returned for enemy types.
##
## Licenses: pools mix CC0 (Ogrebane, rubberduck #2, Kenney) and CC-BY 3.0
## (Little Robot Sound Factory, Jesus Lastra) — attribution lives in
## assets/resources-phase1/audio/LICENSES.md and must stay in game credits.
## Credits for James's own work use "Aethelwarden Solas" only.
